  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Punjab Municipal Services Improvement Project (PMSIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to improve the viability and effectiveness of urban services provided by the participating TMAs, and to make such improvements sustainable and replicable in other TMAs through the creation of a performance-based management framework at both TMA and provincial levels.</narrative>
  </description>
